 Data: Financial Modeling Prep ; Chart: Dan Primack/Axios Nelson Peltz once again is interested in taking Wendy's private.

 Peltz's Trian Fund Management reportedly is prepping a takeover bid in partnership with BlueFive Capital and Wendy's franchisee Flynn Group. Trian has been involved with Wendy's for over two decades, and most recently floated a takeover in 2022 before abandoning the idea months later . Wendy's shares rose 14.7% yesterday on the news, but remain down over the past year on slumping same-store sales.

 
 
